Vālmīki questions Nārada about ideal man --- Nārada names Rāma of Ikṣvāku race --- Rāma honors exile and Bharata waits at Nandigrāma --- Rāma kills Khara, Triśiras, Dūṣaṇa in forest --- Rāvaṇa steals Sītā with Mārīca trick --- Rāma befriends Sugrīva and slays Vālin --- Hanumān leaps ocean and finds Sītā --- Rāma has Nala build bridge and slays Rāvaṇa --- Rāma crowns Vibhīṣaṇa and regains kingdom --- Nārada praises Rāmāyaṇa reading fruit